 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 1.0200000000000011,
   "end": 4.58,
   "text": " 10 out of 10 marketing skills for cloud that everyone needs, but they get increasingly"
  },
  {
   "start": 4.58,
   "end": 5.36,
   "text": " more powerful."
  },
  {
   "start": 5.7,
   "end": 7.38,
   "text": " And this is absolutely insane."
  },
  {
   "start": 7.88,
   "end": 9.98,
   "text": " Number one is the head of content skill by Brad Automates."
  },
  {
   "start": 10.06,
   "end": 13.18,
   "text": " It tracks top creators and turns their patterns into your next content."
  },
  {
   "start": 14.76,
   "end": 16.16,
   "text": " Number two is the AI SEO skill."
  },
  {
   "start": 16.3,
   "end": 19.9,
   "text": " It rewrites your content so AI engines like chat GPT and cloud can actually rank it."
  },
  {
   "start": 20.22,
   "end": 25.4,
   "text": " And this is what some softwares charge thousands of dollars for."
  },
  {
   "start": 26.5,
   "end": 27.84,
   "text": " Number three is the brand guideline skill."
  },
  {
   "start": 27.84,
   "end": 34.16,
   "text": " It applies a full brand system to your business, like colors, fonts, and voice."
  },
  {
   "start": 34.58,
   "end": 36.1,
   "text": " Number four is the anthropic marketing plugin."
  },
  {
   "start": 36.46,
   "end": 39.62,
   "text": " Just one install gives you six commands and it's wired straight into a hotspot."
  },
  {
   "start": 40.06,
   "end": 44.06,
   "text": " Just one install gives you six commands and it's wired straight into a hotspot."
  },
  {
   "start": 46.5,
   "end": 48.5,
   "text": " Number five is the marketing council skill."
  },
  {
   "start": 48.64,
   "end": 52.2,
   "text": " It simulates an entire board of marketing experts debating your strategy before you"
  },
  {
   "start": 52.2,
   "end": 52.76,
   "text": " commit to it."
  },
  {
   "start": 52.76,
   "end": 54.8,
   "text": " And number six is the let's see skill."
  },
  {
   "start": 57.92,
   "end": 62.16,
   "text": " It finds real creators and B2B leads across a hundred live sources, then verifies each"
  },
  {
   "start": 62.16,
   "end": 63.4,
   "text": " email before you reach out."
  },
  {
   "start": 63.66,
   "end": 67.78,
   "text": " And number seven is the campaign launcher at OSS cut cut number seven is the campaign"
  },
  {
   "start": 67.78,
   "end": 68.54,
   "text": " launcher OSS."
  },
  {
   "start": 68.76,
   "end": 72.42,
   "text": " It actively plans and launches a multi-channel ad campaign directly for your business."
  },
  {
   "start": 79.52000000000001,
   "end": 83.96,
   "text": " If you want the full marketing skills cut cut, if you want the full marketing"
  },
  {
   "start": 83.96,
   "end": 86.66,
   "text": " skills set up, comment marketing and I'll send it to you."
  }
